# KHOR Beauty Clinic Frontend Documentation

## 1. Project Overview

KHOR Beauty Clinic frontend is a Next.js web application built for a beauty clinic website and admin dashboard.

The frontend supports two main areas:

1. Public customer website
2. Admin management dashboard

The public website allows customers to view services, make bookings, and submit contact enquiries. The admin dashboard allows staff to manage bookings, enquiries, payment statuses, and service-related information.

